Box 52207 (0 of 2 on 0129): after „კი, და უთხარი, რომ მე გირჩიე" the
recommended notary got the 1696 line — the helper's own question, „do you
know a notary?" — and no word that the helper had recommended her.

When the helper's line RECOMMENDED her to help (recommendsSomebody on the
line the card answered), she reads who recommended her (or that somebody
did, after the unnamed tap), who is looking for help, and the goal's own
words, quoted. Names are the ones she knows: her label for them, else
their registered name; the helper's in the ergative (geoName). An order
to ask somebody keeps the 1696 line, and so does every language but
Georgian.

User-visible text (D44): RECOMMENDED_RELAY_ON stays false until Misho's
yes on the exact lines (NIGHT_QUESTIONS BN). With it off, nothing changes.

